  "description": "With nothing to his name but a drop-dead gorgeous face, Kim Moran finds himself about to hit the streets after getting dumped by his lover. Enter Kwon Hosu: a rich, ridiculously attractive younger guy who confesses his undying love and offers Moran a place to stay. Expecting a sweet, easygoing dynamic with a wealthy boyfriend, Moran moves in, only to be swept up in Hosu’s overwhelming, intoxicating devotion. But beneath Hosu's adorable smile lies a side so intense, Moran can't help but wonder what secrets his boyfriend is hiding.\n\n(Source: Lezhin US)",
